---
version: 2.0.2
title: catalogue: grice/invalid-report
---
error[grice/invalid-report]: A rule made an invalid report

The rule `fixture/out-of-bounds` reported a problem in the module `app`, at
`src/app.gleam`, with a span that isn't valid for the module's source.
grice can't show where it points, so the report is dropped.

The span of the primary label, from byte 0 to byte 99, isn't inside the
source, which is 20 bytes long.

Hint: This is a bug in the rule, so please report it to the rule's author.
The other reports of the run are unaffected.


